('High','Date preference cannot be the whole trip','15–18 February is three hotel nights, below the requested seven-night minimum. The proposed baseline includes it but extends to 22 February. Total time away and flight buffers remain unresolved. Source: user brief; venue links do not verify personal leave.',['quote-2027-02-15']),
