('Medium','Museum website and exhibition changes','Old .net scheduled to stop 1 January 2027. New .cn visit pages read successfully; .cn homepage failed once. People’s Square hosts only Americas exhibition during trip; East is the permanent-collection alternative.',['museum-old','west','east']),
('Medium','Matching social previews are incomplete','No direct matching social preview confirmed for T’ang Court Shanghai, Shanghai Tavern, or Yi Long Court. Hong Kong namesake, sports and generic Shanghai search hits rejected. Blank media cells are deliberate.',['tang','tavern','m-yi']),
