questions=[('What is the actual time away?','Known: a 1–2 week trip requested; preferred 15–18 February. Unknown: leave beyond those days and international-flight buffers.','Discovery: retain 15–22 February as an uncommitted baseline; obtain flight schedules only after origin is established. No assumed answer.'),('Which city is the best match?','Known: China and Michelin-led dining. Unknown: city preference and comparative nationwide hotel/transit evidence.','Discovery: compare a second city on the same room, cost and one-hour-route basis before claiming a national winner.'),('What is the spending ceiling?','Known: compare total costs for a couple, not per-person figures. Unknown: hotel, dining and whole-trip maximums; breakfast and alcohol preferences.','Discovery: build complete itemized totals first. Do not invent a comfort budget or assume luxury hotels are affordable.'),('Are entry requirements satisfied?','Known: two adults. Unknown: citizenship, passport validity, visa status, origin and transit stops.','Discovery: match the actual passports and itinerary to current destination immigration and consular rules. Personal identity cannot be discovered from public sources; do not infer it.'),('Are menus and routes suitable?','Known: private bathroom and queen-equivalent or larger bed required; aim for ≤60-minute transit trips. Unknown: allergies, dietary restrictions, mobility and walking tolerance.','Discovery: obtain operator allergen/accessibility guidance and complete routes; until personal constraints are known, describe suitability as unresolved.'),('Can the hotel be booked safely?','Known: documented bed options for three hotels, bathrooms for two. Unknown: room inventory, full price, refundable terms and payment constraints.','Discovery: capture dated official checkout totals and terms without submitting a booking. Require a specific bed type, not a general request.'),('Will the venues be open on the chosen dates?','Known: published normal hours, weekly conflicts, spa renovation and museum branch rules. Unknown: 2027 holiday exceptions, release windows and table availability.','Discovery: use dated operator notices and reservation calendars. Current normal hours are not future guarantees.')]
